---
import Verticalgrid from "../assets/Verticalgrid.astro";
---

<section class="relative overflow-x-hidden">
  <Verticalgrid />
  <div class="relative px-8 py-12 mx-auto max-w-7xl md:px-12 lg:px-32 lg:pt-24">
    <div class="mx-auto text-center">
      <!---<span
        class="text-xs font-medium tracking-widest text-transparent uppercase bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-indigo-300 via-indigo-400 to-indigo-300"
        >OUR CUSTOMERS</span
      >--->
      <p class="mt-8 text-3xl font-normal tracking-tight text-white">
        How it works
      </p>
      <!---<p class="max-w-xl mx-auto mt-4 text-base text-vulcan-300">
        This are the customers we have paid to say something nice anytime we ask
        them, they will do anything we ask because we have the do.
      </p>--->
    </div>
    <ul
      class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 mt-12 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 lg:mt-24">
      <li>
        <div
          class="flex flex-col justify-between h-full p-8 border shadow-2xl lg:p-10 border-white/5 rounded-3xl bg-vulcan-800">
          <div>
            <div class="flex gap-x-1">
              
            </div><p class="mt-4 text-base text-vulcan-300">
              "I've always been concerned about privacy online, but since using
              this platform, I feel more empowered and in control of my personal
              data."
            </p>
          </div><footer class="mt-8">
            <p class="text-indigo-300 font-display lg:text-sm">Michael A</p>
          </footer>
        </div>
      </li><li>
        <div
          class="flex flex-col justify-between h-full p-8 border shadow-2xl lg:p-10 border-white/5 rounded-3xl bg-vulcan-800">
          <div>
            <div class="flex gap-x-1">
              
            </div><p class="mt-4 text-base text-vulcan-300">
              "As a professional working with sensitive information, I needed a
              communication solution that prioritizes security"
            </p>
          </div><footer class="mt-8">
            <p class="text-indigo-300 font-display lg:text-sm">John D</p>
          </footer>
        </div>
      </li><li>
        <div
          class="flex flex-col justify-between h-full p-8 border shadow-2xl lg:p-10 border-white/5 rounded-3xl bg-vulcan-800">
          <div>
            <div class="flex gap-x-1">
              
            </div><p class="mt-4 text-base text-vulcan-300">
              "As a digital nomad, maintaining my privacy while communicating is
              crucial. This platform has become my go-to choice for secure
              messaging."
            </p>
          </div><footer class="mt-8">
            <p class="text-indigo-300 font-display lg:text-sm">Emily R</p>
          </footer>
        </div>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>
